gallery.description:
A panoramic view of the New York Harbor waterfront seen from Long Island in 1727. This is an inset from A Map of the British Empire in America with the French and Spanish Settlements adjacent thereto, by Henry Popple. It was originally engraved by Willm. Henry Toms (who also signed it) &amp; R.W. Seale, issued in 1733.[1]
Image Title:  New York
A. The Fort;
